      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    weight_1 = 0.30\n    weight_2 = 0.70\n    std_dev_1 = 0.12\n    std_dev_2 = 0.25\n    correlation = 0.20\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    covariance = correlation * std_dev_1 * std_dev_2\n    portfolio_variance = (\n        weight_1**2 * std_dev_1**2\n        + weight_2**2 * std_dev_2**2\n        + 2 * weight_1 * weight_2 * covariance\n    )\n    portfolio_std_dev_percentage = portfolio_variance**0.5 * 100\n    answer = round(portfolio_std_dev_percentage, 2)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
